    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841530/extras/675bc5b4a36cede081fa300be0c2d584.poster.avif?t=1673444100\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841530/extras/675bc5b4a36cede081fa300be0c2d584.webm?t=1673444100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841530/extras/675bc5b4a36cede081fa300be0c2d584.mp4?t=1673444100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>&quot;The Divide&quot; Is a tactical turn-based strategy game, with deckbuilding elements, set in a divided land, fight for your king, and unite the kingdom!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>THINK</strong> - Inspired by XCOM and the likes, we thrive to make a intersting game that is tough, and will make you think about each combat differently.<br></li><li> <strong>BUILD YOUR DECK</strong> - A huge selection of cards to to choose from, build your own deck, and have fun experimenting with different card combos to make your enemies bow down!<br></li><li> <strong>UNIQUE HEROES</strong> - Each hero is unique, meaning once you find a hero, you need to keep him safe! death is permanent, and a hero deaths will make sure to keep you on your toes.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841530/extras/675bc5b4a36cede081fa300be0c2d584.poster.avif?t=1673444100\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841530/extras/675bc5b4a36cede081fa300be0c2d584.webm?t=1673444100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841530/extras/675bc5b4a36cede081fa300be0c2d584.mp4?t=1673444100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>&quot;The Divide&quot; Is a tactical turn-based strategy game, with deckbuilding elements, set in a divided land, fight for your king, and unite the kingdom!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>THINK</strong> - Inspired by XCOM and the likes, we thrive to make a intersting game that is tough, and will make you think about each combat differently.<br></li><li> <strong>BUILD YOUR DECK</strong> - A huge selection of cards to to choose from, build your own deck, and have fun experimenting with different card combos to make your enemies bow down!<br></li><li> <strong>UNIQUE HEROES</strong> - Each hero is unique, meaning once you find a hero, you need to keep him safe! death is permanent, and a hero deaths will make sure to keep you on your toes.</li></ul>",
